    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore Weblab\r\n\r\nTake **5 minutes** to explore Web Lab.\r\n\r\nClick around and see what you can discover. For example, can you figure out how to get AI to make changes to the page?\r\n",
    "teacher_markdown": "Encourage students to try out as many buttons and features as they can. Remind them not to worry - they can't break anything on the page.\r\n\r\nAs they explore, students should naturally discover:\r\n- Instructions\r\n- File panel\r\n- `index.html` file\r\n- `style.css` file\r\n- `computer.jpg` file\r\n- Code/Preview/Split View tab\r\n- AI Tutor\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
